  <Geometry x:Key="IconFolder">M3.5,6.5 A1.5,1.5 0 0 1 5,5 H9.3 L11.3,7.5 H19 A1.5,1.5 0 0 1 20.5,9 V17.5 A1.5,1.5 0 0 1 19,19 H5 A1.5,1.5 0 0 1 3.5,17.5 Z</Geometry>

